v1.9: click on video to load nearest preset (per-camera calibration, sends only !ptzload)
v1.9
 - New UI based on the ptz.app web version (layout, thumbnails, camera search, resizable lists)
 - Control pad with zoom/focus/move tabs, CF and NFC focus modes
 - Spin speed selectors and circle spin pad
 - Web swap presets (wden, win-ws, wolf-ws) added
 - Preset sort A-Z, grid size, hotkey hints
 - Live Twitch chat widget (server-sent events from the local server)
 - Radial camera menu (middle click or `)
 - Widget show/hide switches in Interface Settings
 - Vendored hls.js, fabric.js, panzoom, intro.js
 - Server runs read-only (no chat sending) instead of failing when no OAuth key is set

v1.8
 - Updated wolf/wolfcorner/wolfin presets, hotkeys, and images.
 - Added thumbnail images to various presets (credit to bagel).
 - Added ptzzoomr option to the side zoom menu with the ability to toggle to regular zoom.
 - Added continuous focus option to the focus menu, can be toggled in interface settings.
 - Added ability to swap cams using Shift + number in addition to Ctrl + number.

v1.7
 - Added zoom dialog for normal clicks (when you click and hold a dialog with zoom values will appear)
 - Removed the top bar and made the video window fixed in place.
 - Disabled number keys from changing cameras when Continous move is switched on
 - Added new multi-cams and fox thumbnails (credit to Wazix)
 - Bug fixes

v1.6
- Added auto cam detection for click and area click
- Added swap hotkeys
- Added setting to change stream URL
- bug fixes

v1.5
- Added search for presets
- Added config setting to disable Full PTZ permission features
- Added zoom control for regular PTZ permissions
- Added ability to collapse side modules by clicking the label
- Added experimental feature to click the video stream to move the camera (full ptz perms)
	- Click the hand icon top right of screen to switch from list/grid view to video view.
	- Select camera, enter zoom (if required) in the zoom module, click in the box on the stream for the camera you selected	
	- Click "Area select" button to enable box drawing for automatic click and zoom
- Added experimental module to interface with MPV for clicking (full ptz perms)
- Added IR control buttons (full ptz perms)
- Added resetcam button (full ptz perms)
- Added quick swap buttons for marms (marmin-marmout), crows (crowin-crowout), wolves (wolf-wolfcorner), wolfin (wolf-wolfindoor), wden (wolf-wolfden)
- Added updated preset screenshots (credit to Taizun)

v1.4:
- Added hotkeys for presets
- Added sound mixer for volume control
- Added custom presets using ptzgetinfo and ptzseta

v1.3:
- Added PanTilt direction pad
- Added setting to disable thumbnails on grid view
- Added List / Grid view switcher
- Added setting to enable / disable keyboard keys

- Web (Netlify) build: build-web.js, web/serverless.js, deploy-web.bat
- Alt+click on a slot: swaps the selected camera with that slot's camera (slots-pano.js v8)
- Pano now opens as circles over the selected camera's slot (hover = preset name, no thumbnails) (slots-pano.js v10)
- Pano shows only the 12 nearest presets to the loaded one (Nearby/All switch) (slots-pano.js v11)
- update13: right click = zoom + focus dropdowns (no custom box, no slot text), click toast shows only preset + degrees, focus widget sends !ptzfocus, pano back to preset-name buttons with hover thumbnails
- update14: Backup and Restore (export/import) under Twitch Settings; yellow box around the selected camera's slot
- update15: middle click toast shows only the camera name; middle click scrolls the camera list to the selected camera
